{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47130","headline":"赠屏风岩栖蟾上人 · 虚中","name":"赠屏风岩栖蟾上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩房高且静，住此几寒暄。\n鹿嗅安禅石，猿啼乞食村。\n朝阳生树罅，古路透云根。\n独我闲相觅，凄凉碧洞门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虚中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}